  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the solution is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
